      "auditors?\\s+in\\s+time\\s+for\\s+(filing|the\\s+filing)",
      "review\\s+process\\s+with\\s+the\\s+auditor|complete\\s+the\\s+review\\s+of.*?auditor",
      "auditing\\s+standards|confirmation\\s+of\\s+balances\\s+required\\s+by\\s+auditing",
      "control\\s+deficienc(ies|y)",
      "no\\s+longer\\s+permitted\\s+to\\s+practice"
